漲跌互見！外資狂砍767億、三大法人單日提款近900億　網友一面倒：小兒準備認錯"> </div> <div class="fns-news-tit"> <p>AI股漲跌互見！外資狂砍767億、三大法人單日提款近900億　網友一面倒：小兒準備認錯</p> <div class="fns-date"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-calendar" viewBox="0 0 16 16"> <path d="M3.5 0a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5V1h8V.5a.5.5 0 0 1 1 0V1h1a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h1V.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5zM1 4v10a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V4H1z"/> </svg> <span>2026.10.19 16:05</span> </div> </div> </div> </a> <a href="/news/588547"> <div class="fns-box"> <div class="fns-img"> <img data-src="https://i01.ftnn.com.tw/270x152/26/291/26291160703870689f1bcd.png" class="lazy" alt="彰化縣長民調藍苦戰！民進黨陳素月32%勝國民黨魏平政16%、42%選民未決定"> </div> <div class="fns-news-tit"> <p>彰化縣長民調藍苦戰！民進黨陳素月32%勝國民黨魏平政16%、42%選民未決定</p> <div class="fns-date"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-calendar" viewBox="0 0 16 16"> <path d="M3.5 0a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5V1h8V.5a.5.5 0 0 1 1 0V1h1a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h1V.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5zM1 4v10a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V4H1z"/> </svg> <span>2026.10.19 16:04</span> </div> </div> </div> </a> <a href="/news/588543"> <div class="fns-box"> <div class="fns-img"> <img data-src="https://i01.ftnn.com.tw/270x152/26/291/26291160322009310a7289.png" class="lazy" alt="洋流發威添信心！ 馬郁雯：民進黨北市議員有望全壘打！"> </div> <div class="fns-news-tit"> <p>洋流發威添信心！ 馬郁雯：民進黨北市議員有望全壘打！</p> <div class="fns-date"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-calendar" viewBox="0 0 16 16"> <path d="M3.5 0a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5V1h8V.5a.5.5 0 0 1 1 0V1h1a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h1V.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5zM1 4v10a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V4H1z"/> </svg> <span>2026.10.19 15:54</span> </div> </div> </div> </a> <a href="/news/588542"> <div class="fns-box"> <div class="fns-img"> <img data-src="https://i01.ftnn.com.tw/270x152/26/291/2629115483776932701178.png" class="lazy" alt="高雄市長參選人財產曝